{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044190/extras/9af1a6a7147455bd1afc1b83930dd4c7.avif?t=1772657132\" width=960 height=160 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044190/extras/072d8a69cd5b6bd0f4581d9acbd71611.poster.avif?t=1772657132\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044190/extras/072d8a69cd5b6bd0f4581d9acbd71611.webm?t=1772657132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044190/extras/072d8a69cd5b6bd0f4581d9acbd71611.mp4?t=1772657132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The greatest RPG ever! (that's a lie)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Townslife! As the name suggests, you'll likely be spending a lot of time in the local town, where you have just recently settled! But that's not the only place you'll visit - be ready to wander around forests, fish in a huge lake, get to know the townsfolk and even go to the nearest mine that is known for collapsing quite often! What more could you possibly ask for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044190/extras/77334500ff82d00d45fbb89863949661.poster.avif?t=1772657132\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044190/extras/77334500ff82d00d45fbb89863949661.webm?t=1772657132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044190/extras/77334500ff82d00d45fbb89863949661.mp4?t=1772657132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Okay but what am I actually going to do in this game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features such\u00a0exhilarating activities as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutting down trees for wood,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selling wood,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planting new trees for more wood,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutting down tre- wait, you want something more than a lumberjack simulator? Well that's too bad.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a more serious note - you'll gather resources that you can sell to earn money or keep them and use in crafting! Place stuff around, customize the interior of your home, go mining in the procedurally generated mine, go fishing, plant your own crops, fight hostile creatures, find hidden treasures, interact with the locals, build a farm and more! There is no set goal or ending - progress however you want, at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">How much content even is there?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep in mind that the game's still work in progress, and you can only expect an early demo sometime soon, so there's not\u00a0<i>that much</i>\u00a0content currently, but I'll keep updating the game and as time goes on, there will be more and more things to craft, place, interact or maybe even fight with! The demo that I will eventually release will keep being updated until it's time for the next step. Until then, stay tuned!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044190?t=1772657132","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044190?t=1772657132","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044190/be7205d79cc728c92fad99963328b3dd25e4384d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772657132","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044190/be7205d79cc728c92fad99963328b3dd25e4384d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772657132","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4404660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044190/extras/9af1a6a7147455bd1afc1b83930dd4c7.avif?t=1772657132\" width=960 height=160 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044190/extras/072d8a69cd5b6bd0f4581d9acbd71611.poster.avif?t=1772657132\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044190/extras/072d8a69cd5b6bd0f4581d9acbd71611.webm?t=1772657132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044190/extras/072d8a69cd5b6bd0f4581d9acbd71611.mp4?t=1772657132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The greatest RPG ever! (that's a lie)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Townslife! As the name suggests, you'll likely be spending a lot of time in the local town, where you have just recently settled! But that's not the only place you'll visit - be ready to wander around forests, fish in a huge lake, get to know the townsfolk and even go to the nearest mine that is known for collapsing quite often! What more could you possibly ask for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044190/extras/77334500ff82d00d45fbb89863949661.poster.avif?t=1772657132\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044190/extras/77334500ff82d00d45fbb89863949661.webm?t=1772657132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044190/extras/77334500ff82d00d45fbb89863949661.mp4?t=1772657132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Okay but what am I actually going to do in this game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features such\u00a0exhilarating activities as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutting down trees for wood,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selling wood,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planting new trees for more wood,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutting down tre- wait, you want something more than a lumberjack simulator? Well that's too bad.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a more serious note - you'll gather resources that you can sell to earn money or keep them and use in crafting! Place stuff around, customize the interior of your home, go mining in the procedurally generated mine, go fishing, plant your own crops, fight hostile creatures, find hidden treasures, interact with the locals, build a farm and more! There is no set goal or ending - progress however you want, at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">How much content even is there?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep in mind that the game's still work in progress, and you can only expect an early demo sometime soon, so there's not\u00a0<i>that much</i>\u00a0content currently, but I'll keep updating the game and as time goes on, there will be more and more things to craft, place, interact or maybe even fight with! The demo that I will eventually release will keep being updated until it's time for the next step. Until then, stay tuned!</p>","developers":["bartek1009"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044190/1c1090a2f3ab1b232d2ae120e4adcde1c9dc5eaf/header.jpg?t=1772657132","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> x64 Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Average Modern Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Pretty much any graphics card that supports OpenGL ES 2.0 or above<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4044190/1245684294/4478cfff053f428f4ebfb6d84772b066a07137e0/1770672616/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770673600","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4044190/1245684294/4478cfff053f428f4ebfb6d84772b066a07137e0/1770672616/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770673600","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4044190/1245684294/4478cfff053f428f4ebfb6d84772b066a07137e0/1770672616/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770673600","id":257283175,"name":"Townslife Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257283175/57b292b9f6be1845007683258b7c015b3edc3779/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770673600"}],"name":"Townslife","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and op